  "title": "JAMANVAAR Admin — Restaurant Operations & Intelligence",
  "text": "Menu version 4 is now live for guests.\nQA-Restaurant-A-1791252294734\nADMIN\nQA-Restaurant-A-1791252294734\nCtrl+K\nNo open shift\nEOD Report\nReconciliation\nAssistant\nLogout\nOPERATIONS\nDashboard\nBilling / Invoices\nOrders\nLive Orders / KDS\n34\nFloor / Tables\nReservations\nKitchen / KOT\nDIGITAL ORDERING\nQR Table Ordering\nON\nMENU & INVENTORY\nMenu & Categories\nCustomisations & Tax\nInventory & Recipes\nPurchasing & Stock Control\nPEOPLE & CASH\nCustomers CRM\nStaff & Roles (RBAC)\nPayments & Split\nOffers & Coupons\nShift & Cash Drawer\nKIOSK\nKiosk Terminals\nANALYTICS & SYSTEM\nReports & Analytics\nPrinters & Devices\nReceipt & E-Bill\nSync & Devices\nRestaurant Settings\nSubscription Plans\nAudit Trail Logs\nBackup & Restore\nHelp & Support\nCustomisations & Tax\n\nChoices guests can add to a dish (cheese, size, spice) and the tax each dish carries. Attach them to dishes in Menu & Categories.\n\nGuest menu\n\nGuests who scan a QR code see the menu you last published, never a half-finished edit. Live now: version 4.\n\nUp to date\nPublish to guests\nPreview what guests will see\n\n2 dishes in 1 categories are live.\n\nCustomisation groups\nNew group\n\nNo customisation groups yet. Guests can only order dishes as they are.\n\nBranch prices & availability\nQA-Branch-A\nQA-Branch-A2\nQA-Restaurant-A-1791252294734 — Main Branch\nQA GST18 Pizza ₹100\nSold here\nQA Pizza 01 ₹299\nSold here\nTax groups\nNew tax group\n\nQA GST18\n\n18% · added on top of dish price · 1 dish(es)\n\nJAMAN AI\nACTIVE",
